WEBVTT

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.777
ajo shokohet,

00:02:00.777 --> 00:02:04.161
dhe ne pritshmerine e nje djali,

00:02:04.161 --> 00:02:07.367
kur ajo lind vajzen e trete,

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:12.906
ajo ndihet fajtore si nje kriminel.

00:02:12.906 --> 00:02:15.540
Jo vetem nena vuan,

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.277
por edhe vajza, vajza e sapolindur,

00:02:18.277 --> 00:02:20.412
kur ajo rritet,

00:02:20.412 --> 00:02:22.547
ajo vuan gjithashtu.

00:02:22.547 --> 00:02:24.600
Ne moshen pese vjeçare,

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.929
ndersa ajo duhet te shkoje ne shkolle,

00:02:27.929 --> 00:02:29.672
ajo rri ne shtepi

00:02:29.672 --> 00:02:34.294
dhe vellezerit e saj regjistrohen ne nje shkolle.